Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:36.90,Title,,0,0,0,,THE WORLD'S FIRST PODCAST
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,So I would rather
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.66,0:00:04.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,almost sit there knowing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.60,0:00:06.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,I am actively getting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.30,0:00:08.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,a UTI than
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.32,0:00:09.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,waking up the person
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:11.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,next to me to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.52,0:00:12.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,like go to the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:14.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,bathroom or forget even
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.12,0:00:15.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,forget even waking them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.36,0:00:16.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,up just being like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:17.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:19.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have to go
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:19.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.98,0:00:20.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,Like this is normal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.98,0:00:21.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,etiquette on a plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.06,0:00:22.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,We know how this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:22.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,works.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.10,0:00:23.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,And I what are
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:24.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,you saying that the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.30,0:00:25.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,normal etiquette is to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.30,0:00:26.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,feel guilty when you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.82,0:00:27.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,ask them to move
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.54,0:00:28.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,or is just to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.34,0:00:29.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,not— I'll ask them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.02,0:00:29.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.20,0:00:30.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,No, the normal etiquette
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.18,0:00:30.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,is if you are
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.62,0:00:31.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,on the aisle, you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.54,0:00:32.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,know that the window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.32,0:00:33.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,person is gonna be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.36,0:00:34.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,going to getting up,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.62,0:00:34.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.94,0:00:35.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,But for whatever reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.04,0:00:36.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,I'm terrified.
